  "pli-tv-pvr20:7.3": "sārambhaṃ aparikkamanaṃ anāpatti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:7.4": "pañhā mesā kusalehi cintitā. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:8.1": "bhikkhu saññācikāya kuṭiṃ karoti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:8.2": "desitavatthukaṃ pamāṇikaṃ ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:8.3": "anārambhaṃ saparikkamanaṃ āpatti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:8.4": "pañhā mesā kusalehi cintitā. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:9.1": "na kāyikaṃ kiñci payogamācare ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:9.2": "na cāpi vācāya pare bhaṇeyya ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:9.3": "āpajjeyya garukaṃ chejjavatthuṃ ",
