  "pli-tv-pvr20:15.6": "pañhā mesā kusalehi cintitā. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:16.1": "telaṃ madhuṃ phāṇitañcāpi sappiṃ ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:16.2": "sāmaṃ gahetvāna nikkhipeyya ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:16.3": "avītivatte sattāhe ",
