  "pli-tv-pvr20:21.5": "pañhā mesā kusalehi cintitā. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:22.1": "itthiṃ hane na mātaraṃ ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:22.2": "purisañca na pitaraṃ hane ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:22.3": "haneyya anariyaṃ mando ",
