  "pli-tv-pvr20:30.5": "pañhā mesā kusalehi cintitā. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:31.1": "na cāpi āraññakaṃ sāsaṅkasammataṃ ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:31.2": "na cāpi saṅghena sammati dinnā ",
