  "pli-tv-pvr20:31.4": "cīvaraṃ nikkhipitvā gaccheyya aḍḍhayojanaṃ ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:31.5": "tasseva aruṇaṃ uggacchantassa anāpatti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:31.6": "pañhā mesā kusalehi cintitā. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr20:32.1": "kāyikāni na vācasikāni ",
